1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:13,190
PHP, created by Rasmus Lerdorf in nineteen ninety four, runs on a web server stack: an operating system, the Apache web server, the PHP interpreter and a MySQL database.

2
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,531
XAMPP bundles them.

3
00:00:14,531 --> 00:00:21,093
Save your file in the htdocs folder, start Apache and MySQL, and open it through localhost.

4
00:00:21,093 --> 00:00:24,791
Double clicking the file will not run the PHP at all.

